.DS_Store
LAMP_DataStore
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- public-copy guard rail ------------------------------------------
# This repository is published without site data; its history was
# filtered of every format below (see PUBLIC_COPY.md). They are ignored
# here as well so that a stray `git add -A` cannot put them back --
# running any pipeline, or even the synthetic self-test, writes files
# of exactly these kinds into the tree.
#
# Files already tracked are unaffected by these rules. To add a
# genuinely publishable figure -- a chart rather than a picture of the
# site -- use `git add -f`.
*.tif
*.tfw
*.aux.xml
*.shp
*.shx
*.dbf
*.prj
*.cpg
*.geojson
*.gpkg
*.qgz
*.qgz~
*.obj
*.ply
*.las
*.laz
*.png
